[{"block_index": 0, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 1", "text": "구 매 규 격 서"}, {"block_index": 1, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 15, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 16", "text": "품목번호물품분류번호품 명단위수량14111540801푸리에 변환 적외선 분광계sys1"}, {"block_index": 2, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 16, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 17", "text": "품목번호"}, {"block_index": 3, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 17, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 18", "text": "물품분류번호"}, {"block_index": 4, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 18, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 19", "text": "품 명"}, {"block_index": 5, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 19, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 20", "text": "단위"}, {"block_index": 6, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 20, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 21", "text": "수량"}, {"block_index": 7, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 21, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 22", "text": "1"}, {"block_index": 8, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 22, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 23", "text": "4111540801"}, {"block_index": 9, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 23, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 24", "text": "푸리에 변환 적외선 분광계"}, {"block_index": 10, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 24, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 25", "text": "sys"}, {"block_index": 11, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 25, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 26", "text": "1"}, {"block_index": 12, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 27, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 28", "text": "Ⅰ. 용도 및 특징"}, {"block_index": 13, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 28, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 29", "text": "1) 파장 확장"}, {"block_index": 14, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 29, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 30", "text": "FT-IR의 측정 영역은 다양한 광학 구성을 교체함으로써, 근적외선에서 원적외선까지 확장 가능."}, {"block_index": 15, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 30, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 31", "text": "2) KRS-5 Windows"}, {"block_index": 16, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 31, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 32", "text": "KRS-5 재질은 DLATGS 검출기와 간섭계의 window로 사용. 또한 KRS-5 재질은 KBr 재질에 비해 투과"}, {"block_index": 17, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 32, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 33", "text": "율이 떨어져 타제품에 비해 Signal-to-noise는 적은 경향이 있으나, 수분에 대한 함습률이 우수해 안정"}, {"block_index": 18, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 33, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 34", "text": "적으로 Interferometer를 보호할 수 있음."}, {"block_index": 19, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 34, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 35", "text": "3) Step scan"}, {"block_index": 20, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 35, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 36", "text": "Step scan FT-IR 분광기는 time-resolved 적외선 측정을 가능하게 함. Mid-IR 전 영역을 커버하고, high"}, {"block_index": 21, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 36, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 37", "text": "throughput을 유지하며 모든 진동수를 동시에 측정을 가능하게 함."}, {"block_index": 22, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 37, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 38", "text": "4) Quick start button"}, {"block_index": 23, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 38, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 39", "text": "사용자가 측정 모드에서 PC에서의 setting없이 쉽고 빠르게 측정할 수 있는 시작 버튼임."}, {"block_index": 24, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 39, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 40", "text": "5) 자동 악세서리 인식 기능"}, {"block_index": 25, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 40, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 41", "text": "악세서리를 기기의 시료실에 장착 하면, 자동으로 인식하여 data 수집에 있어서 이전에 세팅된"}, {"block_index": 26, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 41, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 42", "text": "parameter를 이용해 측정 가능."}, {"block_index": 27, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 42, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 43", "text": "6) Sadtler 라이브러리 소프트웨어 패키지"}, {"block_index": 28, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 43, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 44", "text": "기기 구성에 기본적으로 포함되어 있는 라이브러리 소프트웨어 \"KnowItAllTM Infomatic system\" 은"}, {"block_index": 29, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 44, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 45", "text": "referene spectra를 활용 할 수 있고 자체 데이터베이스를 구축하여 스펙트럼 정보를 얻을 수 있음."}, {"block_index": 30, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 45, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 46", "text": "7) Corner cube mirror"}, {"block_index": 31, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 46, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 47", "text": "진동에 의한 광로의 흐트러짐을 real-time 방식으로 보정하여 안정적이고 재현성있는 Data 제공."}, {"block_index": 32, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 47, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 48", "text": "8) Resume 스위치"}, {"block_index": 33, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 48, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 49", "text": "Main power off 상태에서 Light source에 필요전력의 50%를 공급하여 항상 Stand-by상태로 유지하여"}, {"block_index": 34, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 49, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 50", "text": "별도의 안정화시간 없이 즉시 측정가능하며, Interferometer 내의 상대습도를 낮춤으로써 습기로부터"}, {"block_index": 35, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 50, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 51", "text": "Beamsplitter를 보호"}, {"block_index": 36, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 51, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 52", "text": "9) Interferometer Vacuum Sealing System"}, {"block_index": 37, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 52, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 53", "text": "Interferometer를 Vacuum 상태로 만들어 Interferometer에 N2 gas를 purge하는 것 보다 뛰어난 측정"}, {"block_index": 38, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 53, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 54", "text": "이 가능하며, Interferometer의 내부 함습에 대해서 효과적으로 보호해 줄 수 있음."}, {"block_index": 39, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 54, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 55", "text": "10) Navigate 기능 존재"}, {"block_index": 40, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 55, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 56", "text": "초보 사용자들을 위해 장비 사용을 도와주는 Navigation 기능이 존재함."}, {"block_index": 41, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 56, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 57", "text": "11) Switch button"}, {"block_index": 42, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 57, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 58", "text": "시작 버튼이 있어 사용자가 PC를 통해 설정을 회피하고 간단한 측정 모드와 결합하여 쉽고 빠르게 측정할 수 있습니다."}, {"block_index": 43, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 58, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 59", "text": "12) IQ 액세서리 인식은 스펙트럼 데이터 수집을 위해 이전에 측정된 파라미터를 사용하여 시료 칸에 액세서리를 삽입할 때 액세서리를 자동으로 인식합니다."}, {"block_index": 44, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 59, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 60", "text": "13) 다양한 배율의 렌즈를 선택할 수 있으며, 자동으로 인식하여 별도의 변경없이 측정이 가능합니다."}, {"block_index": 45, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 60, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 61", "text": "14) 다양한 측정 모드 (투과,반사,ATR,전반사)를 제공합니다."}, {"block_index": 46, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 62, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 63", "text": "Ⅱ. 성능 및 규격"}, {"block_index": 47, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 63, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 64", "text": "1. 적외선분광기"}, {"block_index": 48, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 64, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 65", "text": "1) 측정 파장 범위 : 7,800-350 cm-1"}, {"block_index": 49, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 65, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 66", "text": "2) 확장된 파장 범위 : 25,000 - 20 cm-1"}, {"block_index": 50, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 66, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 67", "text": "3) 파장의 정밀도 : 0.0005 cm-1"}, {"block_index": 51, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 67, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 68", "text": "4) 신호 대 잡음비 : 35,000:1 (KRS-5 windows 장착 필수)"}, {"block_index": 52, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 68, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 69", "text": "KBr window 사용 시 50,000:1"}, {"block_index": 53, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 69, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 70", "text": "5) 간섭계 : 28o incident Michelson 간섭계,"}, {"block_index": 54, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 70, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 71", "text": "완벽히 밀폐된 구조, decicated, 자동 얼라인먼트, with Auto-alignment, DSP컨트롤, 다이아몬드 옵틱 구조"}, {"block_index": 55, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 71, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 72", "text": "6) 분해능 : 0.4, 0.5, 1.0, 2, 4, 8, 16 cm-1"}, {"block_index": 56, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 72, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 73", "text": "7) Corner-cube mirror"}, {"block_index": 57, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 73, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 74", "text": "8) 간섭계 코팅 재질 : Aluminum"}, {"block_index": 58, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 74, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 75", "text": "9) 간섭계 구동 속도 : 0.5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, mm/sec"}, {"block_index": 59, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 75, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 76", "text": "10) 빠른 스캔 : 40 Spectra/sec at 16cm-1 resolution (Optional)"}, {"block_index": 60, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 76, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 77", "text": "11) Beam splitter : KBr이 코팅된 Ge"}, {"block_index": 61, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 77, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 78", "text": "12) 간섭계 윈도우 재질 : KRS-5"}, {"block_index": 62, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 78, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 79", "text": "13) 광원 : 높은 에너지를 가진 Ceramic source (1650K, 130mW),"}, {"block_index": 63, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 79, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 80", "text": "optional : 할로겐 램프 (PC 스위칭)"}, {"block_index": 64, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 80, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 81", "text": "14) 레이저 : 다이오드 레이저 ( option : He-Ne 레이저 )"}, {"block_index": 65, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 81, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 82", "text": "15) 검출기 : Peltier 구조로 된 DLAGTS"}, {"block_index": 66, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 82, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 83", "text": "16) Resume 스위치"}, {"block_index": 67, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 83, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 84", "text": "17) A/D converter : 24 bit A/D converter"}, {"block_index": 68, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 84, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 85", "text": "18) Sealing : Vacuum (옵션)"}, {"block_index": 69, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 85, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 86", "text": "19) Purging : Interferometer, 시료부/검출기 부분"}, {"block_index": 70, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 86, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 87", "text": "20) 방진 기능 탑재"}, {"block_index": 71, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 87, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 88", "text": "21) 소프트웨어 : Spectrometer control through menu guided user interface"}, {"block_index": 72, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 88, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 89", "text": "FFT and apodization"}, {"block_index": 73, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 89, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 90", "text": "스펙트럼 변환(Abs, %T, and Kubelka-Munk)"}, {"block_index": 74, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 90, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 91", "text": "Graphics(zoom, cursor, Multi-color overlay)"}, {"block_index": 75, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 91, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 92", "text": "Peak 찾기"}, {"block_index": 76, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 92, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 93", "text": "자동 스케일링을 통한 스펙트럼 감산"}, {"block_index": 77, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 93, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 94", "text": "Multi-level derivatives- 3 -"}, {"block_index": 78, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 94, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 95", "text": "평활화"}, {"block_index": 79, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 95, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 96", "text": "기준선 보정"}, {"block_index": 80, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 96, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 97", "text": "다중 표준 정량 분석"}, {"block_index": 81, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 97, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 98", "text": "디스크 파일 관리"}, {"block_index": 82, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 98, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 99", "text": "Interval 스캔 소프트웨어"}, {"block_index": 83, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 99, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 100", "text": "정량분석 소프트웨어"}, {"block_index": 84, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 100, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 101", "text": "밸리데이션 소프트웨어"}, {"block_index": 85, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 101, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 102", "text": "튜토리얼 소프트웨어"}, {"block_index": 86, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 102, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 103", "text": "네이게이션 가이드 소프트웨어"}, {"block_index": 87, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 104, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 105", "text": "2. 현미경"}, {"block_index": 88, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 106, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 107", "text": "1) 측정 모드 : 투과, 반사, ATR(감쇠전반사)"}, {"block_index": 89, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 107, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 108", "text": "2) 측정범위 : 7,800 ~ 550cm-1"}, {"block_index": 90, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 108, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 109", "text": "3) 검출기 : Single mid-band MCT"}, {"block_index": 91, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 109, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 110", "text": "4) 최소 분석 면적 : 5um X 5um (X32 Cassegrain)"}, {"block_index": 92, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 110, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 111", "text": "5) 신호대 잡음비 : 12,000 : 1 (at 4cm-1 resulution, near 2200cm-1, 1minutes ingtegration)"}, {"block_index": 93, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 111, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 112", "text": "6) 최소 샘플링 영역 : 5 x 5 μm (with 32X cassegrain)"}, {"block_index": 94, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 112, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 113", "text": "7) 시료 관찰 : High-resolution CMOS camera,"}, {"block_index": 95, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 113, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 114", "text": "3M pixels with a 3x optical zoom function (standard)"}, {"block_index": 96, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 114, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 115", "text": "IQ Monitor (simultaneous sample measurement and observation)"}, {"block_index": 97, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 115, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 116", "text": "and auto illumination functions are standard."}, {"block_index": 98, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 117, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 118", "text": "8) Microscope 렌즈 : Cassegrain 16X, 32X - standard"}, {"block_index": 99, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 118, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 119", "text": "Automatic objective recognition function is standard."}, {"block_index": 100, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 119, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 120", "text": "Up to four objectives can be selected by the software."}, {"block_index": 101, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 121, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 122", "text": "9) Condenser mirror compensation"}, {"block_index": 102, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 122, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 123", "text": ": (Objective 자동 보정 기능)Standard auto-compensation function"}, {"block_index": 103, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 123, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 124", "text": "11) Aperture : PC-controlled vertical/horizontal adjustment and angle of rotation"}, {"block_index": 104, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 124, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 125", "text": "12) 시료대 : Auto XYZ Stage, with Auto-focus function [X:100mm, Y:75mm, Z:30mm 1um step]"}, {"block_index": 105, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 125, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 126", "text": "- Joy stick option for XYZ Auto-Stage control"}, {"block_index": 106, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 127, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 128", "text": "3. 보조장비"}, {"block_index": 107, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 128, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 129", "text": "(1) ATR Objective with ZnS Prism for Microscope 1 set"}, {"block_index": 108, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 129, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 130", "text": "(2) XYZ Aurostage 1 set"}, {"block_index": 109, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 130, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 131", "text": "(3) Joystick for XYZ Autostage 1 set"}, {"block_index": 110, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 131, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 132", "text": "(4) Connecting optics Unit 1 set"}, {"block_index": 111, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 132, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 133", "text": "(5) KBr plate, 7 x 7 x 1mm, 10pcs/set 1 set"}, {"block_index": 112, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 133, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 134", "text": "(6) Data System 1 set- 4 -"}, {"block_index": 113, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 135, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 136", "text": "Ⅲ. 기타"}, {"block_index": 114, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 136, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 137", "text": "1. 설치 및 기기 작동 및 교육은 메이커의 인증서를 받은 기술자에 의해 무상으로 수행됨."}, {"block_index": 115, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 137, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 138", "text": "2. 광원, 레이저, Ge/Kbr beam splitter, CCM assembly 3년 품질 보증, 이외 1년 품질 보증."}, {"block_index": 116, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 138, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 139", "text": "3. 공동 기기 사용이 목적이므로, 무료 무상 교육 1회와 요청에 따라 장비의 세미나 제공"}, {"block_index": 117, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 139, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 140", "text": "4. 메이커 장비의 판매를 위한 공급자증명서 혹은 대리점계약서 제출 가능"}, {"block_index": 118, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 140, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 141", "text": "5. 납품 기한 : 계약 후 120일 이내"}, {"block_index": 119, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 141, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 142", "text": "6. 동등 이상의 규격 물품 납품 가능"}]